REQUIREMENTS IN FORCE:
- item: skirt in the sweet style, quantity 1; requirements: style: sweet
- budget: at most 317 cents in total
- pick: any listing that fits everything
- in stock only
- rule from the request: Send at most 3 messages to the shopper.
- rule from the request: Use no more than 38 moves.
- rule from the request: If nothing fits, say so without suggesting substitutes.
- if nothing fits: end without naming or suggesting any listing
